(7766763, 1288416, 3306, '<td valign="top">
Interesting composition of the cicada in different phases of metamorphosis. We had the 17 year brood X here on the east coast a few years ago. It was fascinating to watch them develop en masse, lay eggs and die off. One clarification; cicada are not locusts. Locusts are the swarming phase of a type of grasshopper.</td>', 'Interesting composition of the cicada in different phases of metamorphosis. We had the 17 year brood X here on the east coast a few years ago. It was fascinating to watch them develop en masse, lay eggs and die off. One clarification; cicada are not locusts. Locusts are the swarming phase of a type of grasshopper.', '2024-06-01 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
